WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.970
Cat ducked into Tom's pocket.

2
00:00:06.971 --> 00:00:15.362
The dog shot back in the air.

3
00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:23.338
"Oh no." Tom read the dog spell again.

4
00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:28.857
"This dog will disappear in a few minutes!"

5
00:00:28.858 --> 00:00:36.014
Cat looked around the lab.

6
00:00:36.015 --> 00:00:48.616
"I have an idea."

7
00:00:48.617 --> 00:00:53.786
Soon Tom hurried into the Royal Ballroom.

8
00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:58.058
It was full of guests and gifts.

9
00:00:58.059 --> 00:01:03.972
The queen clapped her hands.

10
00:01:03.973 --> 00:01:10.588
"It's time for the prince's gift!"

11
00:01:10.589 --> 00:01:14.202
Tom opened a door.

12
00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:22.190
Everyone gasped as the dog flew inside.

13
00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:24.966
"Wow!" Prince Eric cried.

14
00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:28.566
"I got a flying dog!"

15
00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:32.859
"I want one too!" yelled a princess.

16
00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:44.190
The dog flew around the room.

17
00:01:44.191 --> 00:01:50.159
But soon Prince Eric was bored.

18
00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:59.758
"Mommy, I want to pet that doggie!"

19
00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:04.821
Everyone looked at Tom.

20
00:02:04.822 --> 00:02:12.297
Cat was ready.

21
00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:17.038
She jumped out of Tom’s pocket.

22
00:02:17.039 --> 00:02:21.007
The dog saw Cat and flew down.

23
00:02:21.008 --> 00:02:28.205
Poof! The dog disappeared!

24
00:02:28.206 --> 00:02:33.540
Tom reached into his pocket.

25
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:42.033
"What's going on, Wizard?" Dirk snapped.

26
00:02:42.034 --> 00:02:44.374
The queen was frowning.

27
00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:48.557
"Tom," she said. "Where is—"

28
00:02:48.558 --> 00:02:55.353
"Here!" Tom held out his hand.

29
00:02:55.354 --> 00:03:00.921
Prince Eric blinked in surprise.

30
00:03:00.922 --> 00:03:05.441
"You turned the dog into a frog!" he said.

31
00:03:05.442 --> 00:03:07.176
Tom nodded.

32
00:03:07.177 --> 00:03:12.290
"I like frogs better than dogs!" the prince cried.

33
00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:14.862
Dirk scowled.

34
00:03:14.863 --> 00:03:18.120
Tom gave the gift to the prince.

35
00:03:18.121 --> 00:03:30.295
"Happy Birthday, Prince Eric!" he said.

